I take the bill.
I go near the entrance.
The elderly gentleman is sitting there.
I give the bill to the gentleman.
He says, "The price is one hundred rupees."
I open my bag.
I take out one hundred rupees.
I say, "Sir, please take the money."
He takes the money.
I say, "The food is very tasty."
"Everything is excellent here, thank you."
He smiles.
He says, "You are welcome, Madam."
"Please come again."
I nod my head happily.
I step outside.
The streets of Mumbai are busy.
I walk happily in the evening.
